 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-- **Path Pattern Mismatch:** Using `%5d` causes issues because printf pads with spaces while other tools pad with zeros. Only `%0Nd` with N=1 is supported [S1, unofficial].
-- **Topology Defects:** Signed mode requires valid topology (no holes) unless `source.allow_holes` is true. Shell mode accepts any topology [S1, unofficial].
-- **True SDF Band:** The pipeline uses `true_sdf = true`, meaning it codes without an observed mask. Ensure the grid resolution and truncation are compatible with this constraint [S1, unofficial].
